                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Godwin established a friendship with the Wedgwood family, 
    including the potter <persName key="WED01">Josiah</persName> (1730–1795) and  two of his surviving sons, 
    Josiah II and <persName key="WED02">Thomas</persName> (1771–1805).  See Thomas Wedgwood for the details 
    of Godwin's contact.  On the basis of previous biographical work, etc., we have 
    identified most 'Wedgwood' entries as Thomas, with contact with the father 
    being slight, and contact with Josiah jr., being identified distinctly by Godwin, during Thomas's
    lifetime, and then acounting for all remaining contact with the Wedgwoods.</p>
                    </note>
                    <note type="editorial"/>
